# The repo root ignores `*.onnx` so nobody commits a trained model by accident.
# The graph in mlp_regressor/ is the deliberate exception: it is a few kilobytes
# and it *is* the cross-language parity gate (ADR-0021). The gate compares Rust
# against a frozen Python answer, so the artifact has to live in the tree —
# regenerating it next to the assertion would prove nothing.
!*.onnx
